      options: {
        A: "Suspicion often stimulates inquisitiveness",
        B: "Every human conduct often gives rise to curiosity",
        C: "Our environment always inhibits curiosity",
        D: "Curiosity is effective where there is no room for it"
      },
      answer: "A",
      explanation: "Official JAMB 2016 English Language Question 62 (Core Syllabus \u2014 UTME Objective). Syllabus objective: Master Core Syllabus (UTME Objective) under JAMB UTME conditions. Verified answer: Option A (Suspicion often stimulates inquisitiveness).",
