      explanation: "Official JAMB 2018 English Language Question 5 (Core Syllabus \u2014 UTME Objective). Syllabus objective: Master Core Syllabus (UTME Objective) under JAMB UTME conditions. Verified answer: Option C (unlimited pleasure).",
