      explanation: "Official JAMB 2019 English Language Question 12 (Core Syllabus \u2014 UTME Objective). Syllabus objective: Master Core Syllabus (UTME Objective) under JAMB UTME conditions. Verified answer: Option A (Mass communication don't talk).",
